{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Solun Calendar 將西曆、農曆、節日、行程與小工具整合於簡潔的日曆介面，適合希望一眼掌握日期資訊與安排的人士。現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-159.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>西曆農曆節日快速查看</h2>\n<p>開啟後可同時查看西曆與農曆日期、節日重點及接下來的行程，並透過系統日曆建立、檢視和管理活動。月曆事件清單支援按日曆篩選，亦可加入主畫面小工具快速存取，介面提供淺色、深色與跟隨系統外觀選擇。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-619-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-620-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-621-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-622-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-623-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-624-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Solun Calendar – Lunar Holiday</li><li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/solun-calendar-lunar-holiday/id1572415524?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-01T03:38:12.955686+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":255,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-31T04:00:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-01T04:18:30.583379+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-01T03:31:38.689163+00:00","content_hash":"c4f4235e124c65b2fb461964b25bf45f85d04b60c2472f5e4cee8427e953a575","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}